# sync-config

Edit files inside `packages/global-packages/packages/dev-tools/`, not host-root copies. After a template change, run `npm run project:bootstrap` and commit the generated host files.

## TypeScript

Ambient / `declare module` types belong in:

`packages/global-packages/packages/dev-tools/types/blockera/`

- Never add or edit a project-root `types/` folder.
- Do not stub packages that already ship TypeScript types (for example `@dnd-kit/*` or `overlayscrollbars`).

## Flow

Templates and stubs belong in:

`packages/global-packages/packages/dev-tools/flow/`

- Never hand-edit the host-root `.flowconfig` or `flow/` stubs.

## Editor config

Templates belong in `packages/global-packages/packages/dev-tools/cspell/` and `.../vscode/`.

- Never hand-edit host-root `.cspell/` or `.vscode/`.
